            "query_handle": "In-store return policy",
            "horizontal_position": 44,
            "content": "<p>Items purchased in-store are eligible for exchange or store credit within 7 days if the bag is unused, you have all tags attached, as well as the original receipt and packaging. Returns or exchanges must be made at the same Crumpler store where your purchase was originally made.<br/><br/>We do no accept returns for online orders in-store.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_text_ji7FPy": {
          "settings": {
            "horizontal_position": 66
          }
        },
        "image_text_RqwTYy": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Orders shipped to Singapore are DDP (delivered duty paid). Upon delivery, you will not be required to pay any additional fees.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_text_8KT6Ui": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><strong>Bought the wrong bag?</strong></p><p>You can return your order within 28 days of purchase, provided the item is unused, has tags attached, and includes the original receipt and packaging.</p><p>International returns can be lodged through our Returns Portal for a refund only.</p><p><strong>To start your return:<br/></strong>- Go to our <a href=\"https://crumplerau.loopreturns.com/#/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://crumplerau.loopreturns.com/#/\">Returns Portal</a>.<br/>- Select the item(s) you want to return.<br/>- Your prepaid return label will be sent to the email used on your order.<br/>- Print the label and carefully follow the return instructions.<br/>- Arrange collection with the courier using the prepaid return label sent to your email.<br/></p><p>If you need help with your return, please contact our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">Customer Care</a> team.</p><p><strong>Exchanges</strong><br/><br/>Exchanges are not available for international orders. If you would like a different item, please return your order for a full refund and place a new order.</p><p><strong>Return labels</strong><br/><br/>Return labels are available through our Returns Portal. Customers are responsible for the cost of the label, which will be deducted from the total refund amount. International returns are shipped using UPS Express Saver.</p><p><strong>Return label costs<br/></strong> -United States and Canada: $65 AUD<br/>- Singapore, Malaysia, Japan, New Zealand, Hong Kong, South Korea, Thailand, China, Taiwan, Indonesia: $20 AUD<br/>- Rest of the world: $65 AUD<br/></p><p><strong>Important information</strong><br/><br/>Multiple orders cannot be returned under a single return request or in the same box. Each order must be submitted separately and returned with its own return label.</p><p>Once your return is received at our warehouse, please allow up to 3 business days for processing. After the returned item has been quality checked and approved, your refund will be issued to the original method of payment and a confirmation email will be sent. While refunds are processed by Crumpler within 3 business days, your financial institution may require additional time to complete the transaction.</p><p>If returned merchandise does not pass the quality check, Crumpler reserves the right to withhold the refund and retain the returned merchandise.<br/><br/>All online order returns must be submitted through our <a href=\"https://crumplerau.loopreturns.com/#/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://crumplerau.loopreturns.com/#/\">Returns Portal</a>, as we do not accept online returns in-store.</p><p><strong>Damaged or defective goods</strong><br/><br/>If you believe you have received a defective or damaged item, or an item different from the one you ordered, please contact our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">Customer Care</a> team.</p>"
          }
        }
      }
    }
